 Group (EMIS)\r\nDirector name: Southby,Peter\r\nAmount purchased: 15 @ 960.00p\r\nValue: £144.00\n\n\n\r\nTop Director Sells\n\r\nSafestyle Uk (SFE)\r\nDirector name: Neale,Robert\r\nAmount sold: 150,000 @ 37.95p\r\nValue: £56,925.00\n\r\nIde Group Holdings (IDE)\r\nDirector name: White,Sebastian\r\nAmount sold: 1,198,190 @ 1.00p\r\nValue: £11,981.90');
